      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the **spawned Ingest agent child process environment, immediately before that process starts**.\n\nThe key point is that the Hub process itself never holds the API key; it remains isolated within the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API. The same pattern applies to the Query agent process as well.",
